  «text (-12000,5780) 1 0 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿* HV bridge M1-M4: NCE65TF099, 650V SJ, TO-220. Rds(on) 89m typ @25C, 156m @100C (model Rd fitted). Qg 45nC, Coss 97pF, Qrr 1.6uC, RthJC 0.39 C/W. Gate 22R / 15V, dead time 200ns"»
  «text (-12000,5780) 1 0 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿* LV bridges M5-M12: AON6226, 100V AlphaSGT, DFN 5x6. Rds(on) 6.4m typ @25C, 10.4m @100C (model Rd fitted). Qg 42nC, Coss 245pF, Qrr 150nC, RthJC 0.9 C/W. Gate 12R / 12V, dead time 150ns"»
  «text (-5600,-2900) 1 0 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿* X1 - HV bridge, dead time 200 ns / X2 - LV bridges, dead time 150 ns"»
  «text (-5600,-6300) 1 0 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿* X2 uses outputs C and D only; A and B are left unconnected"»
  «text (9000,-12300) 1 0 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿* core loss PQ32/30 N87: 4.8 W per transformer at 200 V (EP 5.2)"»
